<!--
    Horological dial ticks for the vitals and activity tile.

    Drawn once as a static VectorDrawable instead of 36 ArcLine elements:
    the tick marks point radially, which an arc primitive cannot express, and a
    forty-element dial would cost more than it shows.

    Geometry is the design render's, verbatim: 36 ticks over the 260 degree
    span starting at 140 degrees, a major tick every 11th, 1.8dp (3.2dp major) long.
    Colour is TileInk.PRIMARY at 10% (minor) and 17% (major).
-->
